ula","r":[0.1231,0.5267,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Rosaria","r":[0.1648,0.5267,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Shenhe","r":[0.2065,0.5267,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dori","r":[0.0815,0.5778,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1231,0.5778,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1648,0.5778,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2065,0.5778,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dori","r":[0.0815,0.6289,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Jean","r":[0.1231,0.6289,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.1648,0.6289,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.2065,0.6289,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dori","r":[0.0815,0.68,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Cyno","r":[0.1231,0.68,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1648,0.68,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.2065,0.68,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/dori/261111-224858/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Favonius Greatsword","text":"CRIT hits make team Energy particles. Build CRIT Rate. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"Wolf's Gravestone","text":"High ATK; situational team ATK buff. If Burst uptime is already secure."},{"name":"Sacrificial Greatsword","text":"Extra Skill gives Energy and particles. Reset must activate. Higher refinements preferred."},{"name":"Katsuragikiri Nagamasa","text":"Craftable Energy refund from Skill hits. Mind its delayed Energy restoration. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"Forest Regalia","text":"ER plus a Dendro-reaction EM leaf buff. Use in Dendro teams; collect the leaf."},{"name":"Makhaira Aquamarine","text":"EM scaling adds an ATK buff for allies. Best on high-EM Hyperbloom variants."},{"name":"Rainslasher","text":"EM boosts reactions in driver builds. Needs enough ER from other sources."},{"name":"Bloodtainted Greatsword","text":"Budget EM for reaction-focused builds. Only with sufficient Energy Recharge."}],"a":[{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants teamwide ATK.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · Healing Bonus"},{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"Reduces enemy Dendro RES.","stats":"Only if nobody else uses Deepwood"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Reactions grant the team EM.","stats":"4-star set; prioritize ER sands"}],"t":[{"name":"Claymore Superconduct","members":["Dori","Eula","Rosaria","Shenhe"],"text":"Dori supplies healing, Energy and Electro for Superconduct; Rosaria and Shenhe support Eula’s Physical damage.","roles":["Healer / Battery","Main DPS","Cryo Battery","Cryo Buffer"]},{"name":"C6 Aggravate Bazaar","members":["Dori","Fischl","Nahida","Sucrose"],"text":"At C6, Dori drives Aggravate with Electro-infused attacks. Fischl adds damage; Nahida and Sucrose enable and amplify reactions.","roles":["On-Field Driver","Off-Field DPS","Dendro Support","Anemo Support"]},{"name":"Swirling Jinni Bloom","members":["Dori","Jean","Yelan","Nahida"],"text":"Jean can Swirl Electro from Dori’s self-application to trigger Hyperbloom. Keep both Bursts active and position close to cores.","roles":["Healer / Electro","Anemo Driver","Hydro DPS","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Cyno Energy Caravan","members":["Dori","Cyno","Nahida","Xingqiu"],"text":"Dori sustains Cyno during field time and helps with Energy; Nahida and Xingqiu enable Quickbloom reactions.","roles":["Healer / Battery","On-Field DPS","Dendro Support","Hydro DPS"]}],"v":"HP Healer: Build ER first, then HP% and Healing Bonus to improve Jinni healing.\nNoblesse Buffer: Use 4pc Noblesse when the team benefits from ATK and no ally carries it.\nDeepwood Carrier: In Dendro teams, equip Deepwood if nobody else handles Dendro RES shred.\nC6 Aggravate: Use EM, Electro DMG, CRIT, and enough ER; C6 grants brief Electro infusion.\nJean Hyperbloom: Pair with Jean for Electro self-Swirls; reaction damage depends on trigger EM.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Healer","Support"],"about":"Dori heals and restores Energy to the active character through her 80-Energy Burst. Prioritize Energy Recharge, then HP and Healing Bonus. Her off-field Electro application is limited, but C6 enables an on-field reaction driver.","pros":["Healing and Energy recovery","Flexible support eq